OL,3,GNEWSASurvey studies wildfire impact on
OL,4,Aforest community
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe long-term impact of a wildfire on
OL,7,Fcommunities and businesses in the New
OL,8,FForest is being assessed in a council
OL,9,Fstudy.
OL,11,FThe blaze, which started on 9 August
OL,12,Fafter a van on the A31 caught fire and
OL,13,Fspread to vegetation on both sides of
OL,14,Fthe road, affected more than 100
OL,15,Fhectares of heathland.
OL,17,FThe closure of the A31 for almost two
OL,18,Fweeks caused severe congestion as
OL,19,Ftraffic was diverted through New Forest
OL,20,Fvillages, and businesses and tourist
OL,21,Fattractions reported drops in income.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
