OL,3,GNEWSASurvey studies wildfire impact on
OL,4,Aforest community
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew Forest District Council said its
OL,7,Fcommunity recovery consultation would
OL,8,Fhelp assess the "ongoing impacts" of
OL,9,Fthe wildfire and help plan for future
OL,10,Fincidents.
